-- Possible DC Shadow Attack | T1207 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_security_possible_dc_shadow.yml | NOTA: fallback QRadarAQL_payload_pipeline: campos sem propriedade DSM mapeada são buscados em UTF8(payload) – custo maior, crie custom properties
SELECT * FROM events WHERE devicetype=12 AND (("Event ID"=4742 AND LOWER(UTF8(payload)) LIKE '%gc/%') OR ("Event ID"=5136 AND (Username='servicePrincipalName' OR "Account Name"='servicePrincipalName' OR "Distinguished Name"='servicePrincipalName') AND (LOWER("Attribute Old Value") LIKE 'gc/%' OR LOWER("Attribute New Value") LIKE 'gc/%')))
